  ("Do I have to wait until 2027 to install a heat pump and still get the federal rebate?", "No. Eligible installations on or after November 1, 2026 may qualify retroactively once applications open, expected in early 2027. Keep your contractor's receipt with the make, model and AHRI number, and remember that no money is paid until your application is approved."),
  ("What if my furnace breaks down this winter?", "The federal program accepts emergency replacements as well as planned ones. Ontario's rebate still requires pre-approval before the new equipment is installed, so call early and we'll tell you what timing is realistic for your home."),
  ("Can I get the federal heat pump rebate on a rental property?", "Yes, if you own it. The home doesn't need to be your main residence. Only one rebate is available per household, even if you own more than one property."),
